BEGIN:VCALENDAR
BEGIN:VJOURNAL
CONCEPT:semcal:concept:report:timesheet
SUMMARY:Work-day Timesheet
STYLED-DESCRIPTION;VALUE=TEXT;FMTTYPE=text/markdown:\n
 A timesheet used to record time spent on a daily basis.\n
 __NOTE: It is important to record time with the correct granularity, as too much granularity can lead
 to administration overhead, whilst too little granularity will not capture the full story.\n
 Too much granularity can also lead to a copy/paste strategy to deal with the admin overhead, which
 also results in insufficient data.__
DESCRIPTION;DERIVED=true:\n
 A timesheet used to record time spent on a weekly basis.\n
 NOTE: It is important to record time with the correct granularity, as too much granularity can lead
 to administration overhead, whilst too little granularity will not capture the full story.\n
 Too much granularity can also lead to a copy/paste strategy to deal with the admin overhead, which
 also results in insufficient data.
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH,FR
RELATED-TO;VALUE=UID;RELTYPE=CHILD:2
END:VJOURNAL
BEGIN:VJOURNAL
CONCEPT:semcal:concept:report:timesheet
SUMMARY:Timesheet - Project A
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH,FR
UID:2
END:VJOURNAL
END:VCALENDAR
